":"大武","textMapHash":3623483150,"text":"ん？それなら連絡が来ているはずだが。","nextNodeIds":[120010306]},{"nodeId":120010306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2073,"speakerName":"大武","textMapHash":3590211286,"text":"旦那様は本日急な用件がある故、面会は全て取り消しされたぞ。","nextNodeIds":[120010307]},{"nodeId":120010307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1295623454,"text":"「用件」って…？","nextNodeIds":[120010308]},{"nodeId":120010308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2073,"speakerName":"大武","textMapHash":1251520422,"text":"旦那様は近頃ある事業で忙しくてな、今日も朝から大事な客人を迎えに行かれた。","nextNodeIds":[120010309]},{"nodeId":120010309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":334615262,"text":"今、どこにいるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[120010310]},{"nodeId":120010310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2073,"speakerName":"大武","textMapHash":668538190,"text":"すまないが、誰にも言うなと旦那様に言われている…","nextNodeIds":[120010311]},{"nodeId":120010311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1191823414,"text":"こっちは客人ではないというの？","nextNodeIds":[120010312]},{"nodeId":120010312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2073,"speakerName":"大武","textMapHash":2288375862,"text":"いやいや、そういう意味じゃないんだ。気を悪くしたならすまない！","nextNodeIds":[120010313,120010314]},{"nodeId":120010313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1905276630,"text":"会わせてくれないとただで済むと思うなよ。","nextNodeIds":[120010315]},{"nodeId":120010315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2073,"speakerName":"大武","textMapHash":2070365742,"text":"すまない、悪かった！旦那様は今、新月軒にいるんだ！","nextNodeIds":[120010316]},{"nodeId":120010316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2073,"speakerName":"大武","textMapHash":18912126,"text":"どうか許してくれ、旦那様には言わないでくれ！","nextNodeIds":[120010317]},{"nodeId":120010317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2135272574,"text":"フン、こっちも急用があるからな、今日のところは許してやるよ。","nextNodeIds":[120010318]},{"nodeId":120010318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":819156030,"text":"茂才公との商談が上手くいったら、おまえの無礼を忘れてやる！","nextNodeIds":[120010319]},{"nodeId":120010319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2073,"speakerName":"大武","textMapHash":372096238,"text":"か、感謝する！その商談に岩神様のご加護があらんことを！","nextNodeIds":[120010320]},{"nodeId":120010320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":573573118,"text":"おまえに演技ができたなんてな、知らなかったぞ！","nextNodeIds":[120010321,120010323]},{"nodeId":120010321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3235643774,"text":"ついね…","nextNodeIds":[120010322]},{"nodeId":120010322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1180309182,"text":"おまえに騙されないよう、オイラも気を付けないとな。","nextNodeIds":[120010325]},{"nodeId":120010325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":410257854,"text":"けど、あの門番が言ってた大事な客人って、たぶん「ファデュイ」のことだよな。","nextNodeIds":[120010326,120010327]},{"nodeId":120010326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":897443246,"text":"そうだと思う。","nextNodeIds":[120010328]},{"nodeId":120010328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":950427078,"text":"おう、さっそく新月軒に行こう！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":120010327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2736153878,"text":"来るタイミングがよかった。","nextNodeIds":[120010328]},{"nodeId":120010323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":239965302,"text":"パイモンもなかなか。","nextNodeIds":[120010324]},{"nodeId":120010324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1702916958,"text":"へへっ、オイラに礼をしたいなら、美味しいものを奢ってくれよ！","nextNodeIds":[120010325]},{"nodeId":120010314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4083265230,"text":"その旦那様に言いつけてやる。","nextNodeIds":[120010315]},{"nodeId":120010304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PL