_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":3459671950,"text":"策はもう考えたよ。この手紙を「飛雲商会」に届けてくれないか？彼らなら、何をすべきか分かってくれるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[120010807]},{"nodeId":120010807,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":4225824854,"text":"訳あって、僕は一緒に行けないけど…","nextNodeIds":[120010808]},{"nodeId":120010808,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":2349943574,"text":"手紙の内容は読まないでくれよ。","nextNodeIds":[120010809]},{"nodeId":120010809,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2910687902,"text":"うわっ、汚い字だな！こんな字、読もうと思っても読めないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[120010810,120010811]},{"nodeId":120010810,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4076517046,"text":"古代文字かな？","nextNodeIds":[120010812]},{"nodeId":120010812,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":1614567718,"text":"ふむ…","nextNodeIds":[120010813]},{"nodeId":120010813,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":2494425414,"text":"だから、読まなくていいと言ったんだ…読んでも読まなくても意味がないからな！","nextNodeIds":[120010814]},{"nodeId":120010814,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10045,"speakerName":"行秋","textMapHash":4080843222,"text":"「飛雲商会」には、この手紙を読める人がいるから心配ない。","nextNodeIds":[120010815]},{"nodeId":120010815,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2828331310,"text":"けど、あの「飛雲商会」が協力してくれるのか？あそこって璃月の大商会の一つだろ、オイラたちに協力してくれる理由が見当たらないけど。","nextNodeIds":[120010816]},{"nodeId":120010816,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2373502438,"text":"「飛雲商会」？","nextNodeIds":[120010817]},{"nodeId":120010817,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3894907718,"text":"璃月に来てから、よくその名前を耳にするだろ？いろんな事業がその商会と関係してるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[120010818]},{"nodeId":120010818,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1520529486,"text":